{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473400/extras/\u7cbe\u7075\u4e0e\u7231\u4e3d\u4e1d1.gif?t=1745487252\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u200b<strong>\u200bRandom Summons, Evolve into Legends!\u200b</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Summon up to six elemental spirits randomly to fight alongside you! Each spirit race possesses unique elemental abilities that can be synthesized and evolved. You might even summon legendary spirits\u2014boasting unparalleled stats and explosive ultimate skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473400/extras/\u5173\u4e8e\u8fd9\u4e2a\u6e38\u620f-\u7cbe\u7075\u5c55\u793a-\u591a\u8bed\u8a00.png?t=1745487252\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u200b<strong>\u200bLuck or Strategy?\u200b</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Both summoning and synthesis are randomized. Test your luck with a single pull to obtain high-tier spirits, or progress strategically to strengthen your roster. Every choice, driven by fortune or foresight, shapes the path to victory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473400/extras/\u5173\u4e8e\u8fd9\u4e2a\u6e38\u620f-\u7cbe\u7075\u5c55\u793a-\u591a\u8bed\u8a002.png?t=1745487252\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u200b<strong>\u200bDiverse Skins, Fresh Experiences!\u200b</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock themed skins as you battle, each with distinct visuals and passive talents to enhance combat. Skins also feature unique progression paths and synergies with specific spirits. Master their combinations to unleash unexpected power!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473400/extras/\u5173\u4e8e\u8fd9\u4e2a\u6e38\u620f-\u7cbe\u7075\u5c55\u793a-\u591a\u8bed\u8a003.png?t=1745487252\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3473400?t=1745487252","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3473400?t=1745487252","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473400/e76889e0b65854594bd4354dfb4811ddadecbf6b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745487252","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473400/e76889e0b65854594bd4354dfb4811ddadecbf6b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745487252","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Wishlist</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473400/extras/\u613f\u671b\u53552-\u82f1\u8bed.png?t=1745487252\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473400/extras/Wishlist.gif?t=1745487252\" /></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473400/extras/\u7cbe\u7075\u4e0e\u7231\u4e3d\u4e1d1.gif?t=1745487252\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u200b<strong>\u200bRandom Summons, Evolve into Legends!\u200b</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Summon up to six elemental spirits randomly to fight alongside you! Each spirit race possesses unique elemental abilities that can be synthesized and evolved. You might even summon legendary spirits\u2014boasting unparalleled stats and explosive ultimate skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473400/extras/\u5173\u4e8e\u8fd9\u4e2a\u6e38\u620f-\u7cbe\u7075\u5c55\u79